  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\n**Given statement :** 5 * 23 * 24 * 4 * 10 * 111\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the * signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷, +, -, ×, =\n\n5 * 23 * 24 * 4 * 10 * 111 ⇒ **5 ÷ 23**__ + 24 - 4 × 10 = 111\n\n0.21 + 24 - __**4 **____**×**____** 10**__ = 111\n\n__**0.21 **____**+ 24**__ - 40 = 111\n\n__**24.21 - 40**__ = 111\n\n-15.79 ≠ 111 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : -, ×, +, ÷, =\n\n5 * 23 * 24 * 4 * 10 * 111 ⇒ 5 - 23 × 24 + **4 ÷ 10**__ = 111\n\n5 - __**23 **____**×**____** 24**__ + 0.4 = 111\n\n__**5 + 0.4**__ - 552 = 111\n\n__**5.4 - 552**__ = 111\n\n-546.6 ≠ 111 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ×, +, ÷, -, =\n\n5 * 23 * 24 * 4 * 10 * 111 ⇒ 5 × 23 + **24 ÷ 4**__ - 10 = 111\n\n__**5 ×**____** 23**__ + 6 - 10 = 111\n\n__**115 + 6**__ - 10 = 111\n\n__**121 - 10**__ = 111\n\n111 = 111 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : +, -, ÷, ×, =\n\n5 * 23 * 24 * 4 * 10 * 111 ⇒ 5 + 23 - **24 ÷ 4**__ × 10 = 111\n\n5 + 23 - __**6 × 10**__ = 111\n\n__**5 + 23**__ - 60 = 111\n\n__**28 - 60**__ = 111\n\n-32 ≠ 111 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
